Description: M-Lab BYOS node measurement stack
 Native systemd packaging of the M-Lab BYOS Network Diagnostic Tool
 (NDT) measurement platform.
 .
 It runs ndt-server and its sidecar services - node registration, heartbeat,
 uuid-annotator, jostler, traceroute-caller and a Prometheus node exporter.
